Cheddar demonstration survey (one branch of it)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
server/tests/SilexGis.Api.Tests/Fixtures/Cheddar-Whitebeam.lox — one branch of the
compiled Therion model the CaveView.js project publishes as its Cheddar
demonstration survey: nine surveys and their two ancestors, the stations belonging
